     Function eellff__ggeettbbaassee() returns a valid file offset if successful, or
     (_o_f_f___t) -1 in case of an error.

EERRRROORRSS
     Function eellff__ggeettbbaassee() may fail with the following errors:

     [ELF_E_ARGUMENT]  Argument _e_l_f was NULL.

